    <description>ALF-RS-04: per-item counterpart of AF_FL_Appraisal_EvaluationSubmit. Fires directly off an AppraisalItem&apos;s own AF_ApprovalStatus__c field changing to Pending (RecordAfterSave, ISCHANGED) and submits THAT ITEM (not the parent Appraisal) into AppraisalItem.AF_AP_AppraisalItem_Manager, which routes to the same AF_Q_UsedCarTeam queue as approver (user explicitly kept the same approver — only WHO approves per-item vs per-Appraisal changed, not who the approver is). Notifies every queue member via Custom Notification when a new per-item approval request enters the queue, same pattern as the Appraisal-level flow it mirrors.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
